# Ignore default stuff
*
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Ignore MacOS annoyance
.DS_Store

# Ignore persistent/perm data obviously too large to store, plus doesn't follow IaC idea of whole homelab
data/

# Ignore env files and actual secrets
root.env
root-secrets/
root-secrets/*

# Don't ignore compose stacks themselves
!stacks/
!stacks/*

# Don't ignore examples to show how system sets up
!root.env.example
!root-secrets-example
!root-secrets-example/*
